  "title": "TFC : Carry on Storage",
  "description": "Knapsacks and Backpacks for Terrafirmacraft",
  "body": "### TFC : Carry on Storage\nThis is a simple mod currently adding 2 Carry on Storage options being the Knapsack and Backpack for Terrafirmacraft.\nThis mod was orignally a small project for mine and a few friends terrafirmacraft server but I decided to Improve the textures and add The Backpack to then release it as a mod.\n\n### In the Second Update:\n- Items having correct weight values\n- Ability to place Knapsacks and Backpacks on Tool Racks\n- New Knapsack and Backpack GUI\n\n### To do:\n- Add Curios Support\n- Knapsacks can't be placed in Backpacks and Vise Versa\n- Update mod page",
